{"id": "33867", "title": "处女夺情", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33867.htm", "intro": "阴谋！这定是大伙联合起来恶整他的阴谋！他不过在「享用」哥儿们送来的生日礼物，却被突然冒出的爸妈逮个正着逼他负责，可怜他硬是结束单身生活，有家归不得窝在朋友家当寄生虫，但这群朋友都被收买了不成？个个啰哩巴唆的游说他回家疼老婆，疼她？好！他就「疼」得她供出真相，呃，但她三句不离「对不起」，害他真相没逼出来，对待她的方式已变了调，然而就在他心甘乐意奉上一颗真心时，她竟带着他的种无缘由的落跑，天啊！到底是谁负了谁？……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33867", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2154208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2154209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2154210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2154211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2154212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2154213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2154214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2154215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2154216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2154217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2154218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2154219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2154220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2154221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2154222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2154223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2154224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2154225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2154226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2154227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2154228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2154229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2154230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2154231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2154232.html", "available":